# Visualize what a single worker emits over several chains against a
# simple two-table FK schema. Output shows, per transaction, the FSM
# state transition, the SQL emitted, and whether the txn committed.
#
# Different seeds may trim different tables out of the sub-DAG; try
# several to see the chain shape vary.

schema simple_pair
